WEBVTT

00:00:01.790 --> 00:00:02.940
<b>Palm Frog</b>

00:00:01.810 --> 00:00:02.940
<b>The</b>

00:00:01.810 --> 00:00:02.940
<b>Swamps</b>

00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:02.940
<b>Smart</b>

00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:06.290
<b>Mage * Aki</b>

00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:06.290
<b>Smart</b>

00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:06.290
<b>Knight
 Thunder</b>

00:00:03.370 --> 00:00:05.410
<i>My name is Narita Shion.</i>

00:00:05.410 --> 00:00:07.740
<i>Like Aoyama, I am a clean freak.</i>

00:00:09.090 --> 00:00:12.090
<i>For observers, being a clean freak 
is nothing but a disadvantage...</i>

00:00:13.870 --> 00:00:15.170
<i>A weakness.</i>

00:00:19.290 --> 00:00:22.330
<i>Attract attention, and you'll have to
interact more with people,</i>

00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:25.070
<i>increasing the risk of your getting dirty.</i>

00:00:25.070 --> 00:00:26.790
Here we go!

00:00:32.230 --> 00:00:36.820
<i>But online, I can communicate without 
the looming stress of getting dirty.</i>

00:00:51.030 --> 00:00:53.010
<i>Quest complete!</i>

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:59.090
<i>Letting people in the real world know
that you're a clean freak is idiotic.</i>

00:01:01.010 --> 00:01:03.910
<i>That's why I keep it a secret.</i>

00:02:37.130 --> 00:02:38.970
<b>#04</b>

00:02:37.530 --> 00:02:38.970
<b>Narita-kun Keeps It a Secret</b>

00:03:04.230 --> 00:03:09.510
<i>This is the only time I can relax at school.</i>

00:03:09.930 --> 00:03:14.190
<i>In an hour, this classroom 
will become a battlefield.</i>

00:03:17.220 --> 00:03:19.220
Yuuko, the camera's on the other side.

00:03:23.580 --> 00:03:27.470
<i>All my classmates are vulgar and ill-mannered.</i>

00:03:27.470 --> 00:03:29.420
<i>Worse than trash mobs in the MMORPG I play.</i>

00:03:38.380 --> 00:03:40.950
<i>Stop screwing around
in the classroom, you vermin!</i>

00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:43.030
Sorry, Narita!

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:49.330
<i>Don't wipe it with your sleeve! 
You're just spreading it!</i>

00:03:50.090 --> 00:03:51.200
It's fine.

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:54.530
I've got the rest.

00:03:54.530 --> 00:03:56.910
<i>The best way is to just not get involved.</i>

00:03:59.300 --> 00:04:03.100
Hey, Aoyama, did you finish 
your morning cleaning ritual?

00:04:03.100 --> 00:04:04.220
Yup.

00:04:04.220 --> 00:04:08.860
<i>I can't fathom why he'd risk getting dirty
by cleaning public property.</i>

00:04:11.130 --> 00:04:15.620
Lately, this online game called 
<i>Monstrosity Hunter</i> has got me hooked!

00:04:29.530 --> 00:04:31.160
Sorry, Aoyama...

00:04:34.060 --> 00:04:36.290
<i>Avoid interacting with others 
as much as possible</i>

00:04:36.290 --> 00:04:39.570
<i>and above all else, prioritize 
reducing the risk of getting dirty.</i>

00:04:41.850 --> 00:04:45.720
<i>That's the smart way to live 
if you're a clean freak.</i>

00:04:50.390 --> 00:04:53.350
<b>Home Economics</b>

00:04:51.450 --> 00:04:53.340
Today, you will be making

00:04:53.660 --> 00:04:56.250
pork miso soup with rolled omelet
and a side salad.

00:04:56.250 --> 00:04:58.510
Each group needs to work together
to make it a delic—

00:05:02.550 --> 00:05:05.690
Wouldn't it be better to wash 
the vegetables with soap?

00:05:06.310 --> 00:05:07.310
Dunno.

00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:10.450
This is hard to watch.

00:05:10.450 --> 00:05:13.420
The girls in our class have zero girl skills.

00:05:19.390 --> 00:05:21.670
Narita's amazing with a knife!

00:05:21.670 --> 00:05:23.360
Not bad!

00:05:23.360 --> 00:05:25.860
<i>I could do this with my eyes closed.</i>

00:05:26.820 --> 00:05:29.540
Aoyama's slicing veg super fast, too!

00:05:31.890 --> 00:05:34.690
The cucumbers are dancing 
and leaping through the air,

00:05:39.010 --> 00:05:40.910
before neatly floating into the bowl.

00:05:40.910 --> 00:05:42.570
This is art!

00:05:42.980 --> 00:05:44.900
That's Aoyama-kun for you.

00:05:44.900 --> 00:05:49.000
That isn't something you can do
unless you use knives a lot every day.

00:05:51.580 --> 00:05:54.340
<i>For a clean freak, that's standard.</i>

00:05:54.340 --> 00:05:58.760
Whoa! Narita's moving super fast, 
without any wasted movements!

00:05:59.880 --> 00:06:03.460
He's finishing dish after dish,
all by himself!

00:06:03.930 --> 00:06:05.420
Should I help?

00:06:06.180 --> 00:06:07.640
Leave it to me.

00:06:07.640 --> 00:06:08.880
Huh...

00:06:08.880 --> 00:06:11.090
<i>I can't eat anything that 
someone else has made,</i>

00:06:11.090 --> 00:06:12.890
<i>so I have no choice but to cook every day.</i>

00:06:12.890 --> 00:06:15.140
Then I'll just do a taste test.

00:06:15.140 --> 00:06:17.150
<i>Don't put the ladle to your lips!</i>

00:06:18.230 --> 00:06:19.390
Yum!

00:06:19.390 --> 00:06:20.530
Thank you...

00:06:20.530 --> 00:06:21.360
<i>Don't put it back!</i>

00:06:21.930 --> 00:06:23.790
<i>I can't eat that soup now...</i>

00:06:23.790 --> 00:06:25.360
This side is done, too!

00:06:26.370 --> 00:06:27.440
<i>Aoyama...</i>

00:06:30.190 --> 00:06:32.680
<i>It looks like a normal pork miso soup...</i>

00:06:36.550 --> 00:06:40.210
<i>What is this delicious aroma 
that grabs you by your stomach?!</i>

00:06:40.690 --> 00:06:43.510
This smells really good, Aoyama-kun.

00:06:44.230 --> 00:06:46.370
I used homemade miso for it.

00:06:46.370 --> 00:06:47.020
Huh?

00:06:47.020 --> 00:06:49.680
<i>Homemade miso? That's cheating!</i>

00:06:50.300 --> 00:06:51.810
Well, let's see how it tastes...

00:06:51.810 --> 00:06:53.140
Thanks for the grub.

00:06:56.990 --> 00:06:58.180
So good!

00:06:58.180 --> 00:07:01.060
My life was worth it for this moment!

00:07:03.670 --> 00:07:04.520
That's not fair!

00:07:04.520 --> 00:07:06.940
I wanna eat something 
Aoyama-kun's made, too!

00:07:06.940 --> 00:07:08.490
Me, too! Me, too!

00:07:09.490 --> 00:07:11.610
<i>Even the people in my 
group are crowding him...</i>

00:07:11.610 --> 00:07:14.310
<i>I won't forget this.</i>

00:07:16.470 --> 00:07:19.390
I'm so hungry, I could die.

00:07:19.390 --> 00:07:21.950
I always get famished by fourth period.

00:07:21.950 --> 00:07:24.370
Just one more hour to go.

00:07:27.770 --> 00:07:28.680
Pork miso soup.

00:07:31.340 --> 00:07:32.380
Pork miso soup.

00:07:32.380 --> 00:07:33.350
Pork miso soup.

00:07:32.690 --> 00:07:36.310
Hey, Yoshioka, we're still in class.
Where are you going?!

00:07:33.350 --> 00:07:34.270
Pork miso soup.

00:07:34.270 --> 00:07:35.270
Pork miso soup.

00:07:35.270 --> 00:07:37.460
Hey, hey, hey now! Yocchi!

00:07:39.890 --> 00:07:40.790
Pork miso soup!

00:07:47.150 --> 00:07:49.610
Is this where the pork miso soup is?!

00:07:50.100 --> 00:07:54.070
More and more people are turning up
because of the scent!

00:07:54.070 --> 00:07:56.780
Your food's capable of drawing a huge crowd?

00:07:56.780 --> 00:08:00.040
What kind of terrifying dish
did you make, Aoyama-kun?

00:08:00.040 --> 00:08:03.000
Gimme some soup!

00:08:03.410 --> 00:08:05.460
The soup is long gone!

00:08:05.780 --> 00:08:07.920
No way!

00:08:10.630 --> 00:08:12.570
I have some fried rice, if you want.

00:08:15.110 --> 00:08:16.800
Fried rice is great, too!

00:08:16.800 --> 00:08:25.270
Fried rice! Fried rice!

00:08:19.400 --> 00:08:20.900
<i>See that, Aoyama?</i>

00:08:20.900 --> 00:08:24.710
<i>At my level, even white rice can become
a delicacy in a matter of minutes.</i>

00:08:28.740 --> 00:08:30.920
Aoyama made chicken rice!

00:08:32.850 --> 00:08:35.160
I'll show you what I can do.

00:08:35.830 --> 00:08:37.060
Please wait.

00:08:42.470 --> 00:08:44.160
It's not chicken rice!

00:08:44.620 --> 00:08:47.530
It's fluffy omelet rice!

00:08:47.530 --> 00:08:49.130
What?!

00:08:49.630 --> 00:08:52.280
Damn, that's not fair, Aoyama.

00:08:52.280 --> 00:08:54.910
<i>Making the egg that fluffy...</i>

00:08:55.480 --> 00:08:59.140
Everyone who's not in this class, 
go back to your own classrooms!

00:08:59.580 --> 00:09:03.510
<i>What should I do? I'm not tough enough 
to get a handle on this situation.</i>

00:09:04.630 --> 00:09:06.060
You should all be in class!

00:09:06.490 --> 00:09:08.520
<i>My saviors!</i>

00:09:08.920 --> 00:09:11.120
What's this? Smells good.

00:09:11.120 --> 00:09:12.280
Can we have some?

00:09:12.280 --> 00:09:13.490
Or not. Just two extra mouths!

00:09:14.540 --> 00:09:15.950
<i>This is bad.</i>

00:09:16.340 --> 00:09:19.410
<i>We don't have enough ingredients
to prepare food for everyone.</i>

00:09:19.410 --> 00:09:21.250
U-Um...

00:09:21.870 --> 00:09:24.890
W-We took this from the dining hall.

00:09:24.890 --> 00:09:26.830
Th-That's a lot!

00:09:27.220 --> 00:09:31.260
<i>All right. With that much food, 
we have way more options.</i>

00:09:34.920 --> 00:09:37.710
Pasta with tomato sauce and mozzarella!

00:09:40.500 --> 00:09:41.730
Meat and potato stew!

00:09:41.730 --> 00:09:43.410
Seafood paella!

00:09:43.410 --> 00:09:44.780
Steak with ginger!

00:09:44.780 --> 00:09:45.930
Pancakes!

00:09:45.930 --> 00:09:47.520
French toast!

00:09:47.520 --> 00:09:50.150
These two can make anything!

00:09:57.070 --> 00:10:00.570
Shion, everything here tastes amazing.

00:10:01.580 --> 00:10:04.250
What's wrong? Aren't you hungry?

00:10:04.250 --> 00:10:07.070
<i>We can't eat food that 
someone else has touched.</i>

00:10:08.020 --> 00:10:08.770
No.

00:10:09.370 --> 00:10:12.100
<i>Anything we want to eat,
we have to make ourselves.</i>

00:10:14.470 --> 00:10:16.630
<i>You have the same issue, don't you, Aoyama?</i>

00:10:18.380 --> 00:10:19.650
I'm stuffed.

00:10:19.650 --> 00:10:21.580
Those two are way too good at cooking.

00:10:21.580 --> 00:10:23.220
I can't eat any more.

00:10:23.220 --> 00:10:25.370
I seriously want to marry Aoyama-kun.

00:10:25.370 --> 00:10:26.130
Me, too!

00:10:26.130 --> 00:10:26.810
Me, too!

00:10:27.950 --> 00:10:32.370
<i>This is dumb. Why did we even 
make food for all those people?</i>

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:39.700
What are you playing at?

00:10:40.330 --> 00:10:43.060
<i>We don't consume anything 
that anyone else has touched.</i>

00:10:44.710 --> 00:10:45.430
Hey...

00:10:47.160 --> 00:10:51.080
<i>Could it be that his germaphobia
has nothing to do with it?</i>

00:10:51.480 --> 00:10:54.540
<i>That he just enjoys cooking?</i>

00:10:55.180 --> 00:10:56.460
Hey, Aoyama...

00:10:58.780 --> 00:11:01.470
Teach me how to make that 
raccoon face in a latte.

00:11:02.830 --> 00:11:03.740
That's a cat.

00:11:04.550 --> 00:11:08.020
<b>Clean 
Freak!</b>

00:11:04.550 --> 00:11:08.020
<b>Narita 
Shion</b>

00:11:04.550 --> 00:11:08.020
"I'll do the rest, so don't 
worry about it."

00:11:08.020 --> 00:11:10.940
<b>Class Rep</b>

00:11:08.020 --> 00:11:11.060
<b>Natural 
enemies 
of the 
clean 
freak!</b>

00:11:08.020 --> 00:11:11.060
<b>Rikiishi Yuuko</b>

00:11:11.060 --> 00:11:13.290
Quest complete!

00:11:13.290 --> 00:11:16.300
<i>In </i>Hunter<i>, you play by forming 
groups called guilds.</i>

00:11:16.860 --> 00:11:20.530
<i>You could say that teamwork 
is the foundation of success.</i>

00:11:24.100 --> 00:11:28.300
Guild Leader, there's a hunter 
that wants to join our guild.

00:11:28.300 --> 00:11:29.450
Oh?

00:11:37.010 --> 00:11:38.170
It's this guy.

00:11:40.050 --> 00:11:42.440
Wait, this raccoon...

00:11:42.440 --> 00:11:43.720
It's a cat.

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:49.890
<i>The hairdo, the sour look...
 And his nickname is Ao—</i>

00:11:48.120 --> 00:11:49.890
<b>Aoi Sanmyaku</b>

00:11:49.890 --> 00:11:52.770
Hi! My name's Aoi Sanmyaku!

00:11:52.770 --> 00:11:55.020
Please call me San-chan!

00:11:56.060 --> 00:11:58.360
He's full of energy, isn't he?

00:11:58.360 --> 00:11:59.880
<i>A-Am I mistaken?</i>

00:12:00.710 --> 00:12:03.530
Nice to meet you.
I'm Smart, the guild leader.

00:12:03.530 --> 00:12:06.320
We're a high-end veteran guild.

00:12:06.320 --> 00:12:08.620
Half-baked hunters won't be able
to keep up with us.

00:12:08.620 --> 00:12:09.900
Will you?

00:12:09.900 --> 00:12:13.790
I'll crush any monster that comes 
my way with these iron fists!

00:12:25.810 --> 00:12:28.370
Iron Ball Shot!

00:12:28.370 --> 00:12:29.810
What happened to using your fists?!

00:12:32.010 --> 00:12:34.270
An OHKO precision kick?!

00:12:34.740 --> 00:12:36.560
Quest complete!

00:12:36.560 --> 00:12:38.610
San-chan, you're great!

00:12:38.610 --> 00:12:44.820
Yay! Yay! Yay!

00:12:41.610 --> 00:12:43.890
<i>Yeah, Aoyama would never celebrate like that.</i>

00:12:55.090 --> 00:12:57.480
<i>He even scrubs places like that?</i>

00:12:57.480 --> 00:12:58.730
Aoyama-kun!

00:13:03.980 --> 00:13:05.060
Um...

00:13:05.060 --> 00:13:06.300
<i>Wait, what's going on?</i>

00:13:06.300 --> 00:13:08.450
P-Please go out with me!

00:13:08.450 --> 00:13:10.060
<i>Seriously? She actually asked him out?</i>

00:13:10.500 --> 00:13:11.900
Sorry, I can't.

00:13:12.520 --> 00:13:17.580
Dammit, why do you have to be all cool
and collected when you reject me, too?!

00:13:18.540 --> 00:13:19.440
<i>Yup.</i>

00:13:20.200 --> 00:13:21.930
<i>This is what Aoyama's like.</i>

00:13:28.740 --> 00:13:29.780
<i>That's...</i>

00:13:29.780 --> 00:13:32.870
<i>That's the official </i>Hunter<i> key ring that 
the game company only gives out</i>

00:13:32.870 --> 00:13:36.750
<i>to the hunters they recognize 
as the best of the best!</i>

00:13:37.070 --> 00:13:39.260
<i>Of course, I have one, too.</i>

00:13:39.260 --> 00:13:43.670
<i>And on the back, they engrave your nickname.</i>

00:13:40.710 --> 00:13:43.670
<b>Smart</b>

00:13:44.140 --> 00:13:45.650
<i>Aoyama...</i>

00:13:48.510 --> 00:13:51.730
<i>In </i>Monstrosity Hunter<i>,
you can have your own room,</i>

00:13:51.720 --> 00:13:55.690
Your room's always so nice and tidy.

00:13:51.730 --> 00:13:54.430
<i>where you invite friends to talk.</i>

00:13:55.690 --> 00:13:56.940
Thank you.

00:13:57.550 --> 00:14:02.610
You know, ever since San-chan joined,
our party hasn't been wiped out once.

00:14:02.610 --> 00:14:08.410
Yes, San-chan's strong, cheerful, 
mindful, kind and I think...

00:14:09.400 --> 00:14:11.500
I might be in love with him!

00:14:16.830 --> 00:14:18.120
He ran away!

00:14:19.770 --> 00:14:21.730
<i>What was that reaction just now?</i>

00:14:25.900 --> 00:14:30.220
<b>Smart</b>

00:14:26.660 --> 00:14:30.220
<i>I don't want to ask him outright 
and make him get all defensive.</i>

00:14:31.030 --> 00:14:33.870
<i>I guess looking at Aoyama's key ring
would be the quickest way.</i>

00:14:34.280 --> 00:14:35.680
What's up?

00:14:36.420 --> 00:14:38.640
Nothing. Do you need something?

00:14:39.610 --> 00:14:41.820
I was wondering if I could copy your notes.

00:14:41.820 --> 00:14:44.760
I forgot to take any earlier,

00:14:44.760 --> 00:14:47.500
and you're so smart and always
take such <i>good </i>notes.

00:14:47.500 --> 00:14:49.110
Please show me!

00:14:49.110 --> 00:14:51.630
<i>My beautiful notes!</i>

00:14:52.340 --> 00:14:56.100
Ah, my head itches.
I forgot to take a bath yesterday.

00:14:56.100 --> 00:14:59.080
<i>I can't let this toad have them! No way!</i>

00:14:59.080 --> 00:15:01.880
<i>But I won't let myself get worked up.</i>

00:15:01.880 --> 00:15:04.520
I reckon it'd be faster to take
 a picture with your smartphone.

00:15:04.520 --> 00:15:06.050
You're a genius!

00:15:07.070 --> 00:15:09.810
Oh crap, my phone's about to die.

00:15:09.810 --> 00:15:11.190
So can I just take them?

00:15:11.190 --> 00:15:13.270
I'm still using them.

00:15:13.270 --> 00:15:15.010
Come on, it'll only take a second.

00:15:15.450 --> 00:15:16.820
<i>Take a hint!</i>

00:15:16.820 --> 00:15:18.980
Is there some reason I can't have them?

00:15:20.980 --> 00:15:24.400
<i>It wouldn't be smart to let myself 
get outed as a clean freak.</i>

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:24.400
<b>Smart</b>

00:15:27.820 --> 00:15:30.010
Hey, don't run away!

00:15:30.540 --> 00:15:31.710
He's back!

00:15:32.310 --> 00:15:35.140
I copied them in the teachers' office,
so you can have these.

00:15:35.140 --> 00:15:36.970
Oh, thanks!

00:15:40.760 --> 00:15:42.710
All right!

00:15:43.570 --> 00:15:45.320
PE next!

00:15:45.320 --> 00:15:46.600
Yeah!

00:15:47.170 --> 00:15:51.550
<i>PE... I may get chance to take
 a peek at Aoyama's key ring then.</i>

00:15:52.540 --> 00:15:54.540
The best time would be 
when everyone's changing...

00:15:58.350 --> 00:16:00.450
Huh? My gym clothes have vanished?

00:16:02.170 --> 00:16:04.730
H-Huh? Wait, they've been stolen?!

00:16:04.730 --> 00:16:06.140
What's going on?

00:16:06.140 --> 00:16:08.830
Rikiishi's gym clothes have been stolen!

00:16:08.830 --> 00:16:09.690
Seriously?!

00:16:10.090 --> 00:16:14.660
All right, boys! Give them back<i> right now</i>,
and I won't report this to the teachers.

00:16:14.660 --> 00:16:20.120
Just so you know, everybody but
the germaphobic Aoyama-kun is a suspect.

00:16:20.570 --> 00:16:24.070
There is only one truth!

00:16:24.070 --> 00:16:26.580
<i>Remove me from your list, too,
Miss Bowl Cut Gorilla!</i>

00:16:27.070 --> 00:16:28.680
But Class Rep,

00:16:28.680 --> 00:16:32.600
how could anyone steal gym clothes from
a locker in a classroom full of people?

00:16:32.600 --> 00:16:35.230
It'd be impossible to do it
without being seen.

00:16:36.590 --> 00:16:39.570
That's true, and we didn't move rooms today.

00:16:39.570 --> 00:16:42.060
Yuuko, when was the last time you saw them?

00:16:42.410 --> 00:16:46.430
I stuffed them into my locker
right before going home yesterday.

00:16:46.430 --> 00:16:50.030
<i>Must have been a real weirdo 
who stole something that filthy.</i>

00:16:50.030 --> 00:16:55.250
The classroom gets locked
right after everyone's left for the day.

00:16:55.250 --> 00:16:58.030
The next time it's unlocked 
is 7 AM the next morning.

00:16:58.030 --> 00:17:03.500
Which means the crime was likely committed
before all of us got here this morning.

00:17:03.500 --> 00:17:07.460
Come to think of it, isn't Narita-kun
always the first one to arrive?

00:17:09.030 --> 00:17:11.160
He always leaves the classrooms last, too.

00:17:11.160 --> 00:17:12.920
It's always the quiet ones.

00:17:14.860 --> 00:17:16.840
Narita, you...

00:17:16.840 --> 00:17:18.470
Gross.

00:17:18.470 --> 00:17:20.430
Me? Gross?!

00:17:20.430 --> 00:17:22.390
<i>What's going on here?</i>

00:17:22.390 --> 00:17:25.390
<i>Don't tell me they actually suspect me!</i>

00:17:26.570 --> 00:17:29.860
Hang on. That's a serious accusation
to make without any evidence.

00:17:30.280 --> 00:17:32.350
But you have no alibi, either.

00:17:32.350 --> 00:17:35.740
And earlier, you were all like, "The best
time would be when everyone's changing."

00:17:35.740 --> 00:17:38.620
I heard it with my own ears,
and if that's not fishy, nothing is!

00:17:38.620 --> 00:17:40.330
<i>Shut up, Miss Bowl Cut Gorilla!</i>

00:17:41.340 --> 00:17:44.250
Show us what's in your bag.

00:17:44.250 --> 00:17:45.790
<i>The horned garidons are attacking, too?!</i>

00:17:48.060 --> 00:17:48.750
<i>Aoyama!</i>

00:17:53.170 --> 00:17:54.370
<i>That rat!</i>

00:17:54.370 --> 00:17:57.220
<i>He walked out like this doesn't affect him.</i>

00:17:57.220 --> 00:18:00.930
Didn't you hear me, Narita?
Show us your bag!

00:18:00.930 --> 00:18:02.180
Don't touch me!

00:18:03.550 --> 00:18:04.640
<i>Crap!</i>

00:18:04.640 --> 00:18:06.020
<i>This is bad!</i>

00:18:08.690 --> 00:18:10.560
He's the culprit!

00:18:10.910 --> 00:18:12.770
Catch him!

00:18:15.730 --> 00:18:22.380
<i>Dammit! I just wanted a quiet and,
above all, </i>clean <i>school life.</i>

00:18:23.090 --> 00:18:25.060
<i>Why is this happening to me?</i>

00:18:25.060 --> 00:18:28.920
<i>Why doesn't anyone believe me?</i>

00:18:33.100 --> 00:18:35.910
<i>No, my face... the floor...</i>

00:18:37.610 --> 00:18:38.340
Excuse me...

00:18:41.900 --> 00:18:44.760
He would never steal this.

00:18:44.760 --> 00:18:46.720
<b>Rikiishi</b>

00:18:47.240 --> 00:18:48.180
Huh?

00:18:49.640 --> 00:18:52.110
<i>A-Aoyama...</i>

00:18:52.630 --> 00:18:55.570
<i>He believed me.</i>

00:18:56.750 --> 00:19:00.020
This gym bag was in my locker.

00:19:01.260 --> 00:19:03.400
Yuuko, don't tell me...

00:19:03.400 --> 00:19:06.260
Oops, I may have gone to the wrong classroom.

00:19:06.260 --> 00:19:07.500
"May have"?!

00:19:14.840 --> 00:19:15.970
Narita Shion.

00:19:16.440 --> 00:19:18.860
It'd be better if you just
let them get to know you.

00:19:20.220 --> 00:19:23.350
<i>He... He saw right through me.</i>

00:19:26.450 --> 00:19:28.630
I have no idea what you're talking about.

00:19:30.670 --> 00:19:32.530
<i>I won't accept that.</i>

00:19:32.530 --> 00:19:35.510
<i>I won't let anyone know 
that I'm a clean freak.</i>

00:19:35.510 --> 00:19:36.720
Narita!

00:19:36.960 --> 00:19:38.120
S-Sorry.

00:19:38.120 --> 00:19:40.670
Sorry for accusing you
without listening to your side.

00:19:41.830 --> 00:19:42.960
Sorry.

00:19:42.960 --> 00:19:43.770
Sorry!

00:19:43.770 --> 00:19:44.660
Sorry, Narita.

00:19:45.070 --> 00:19:47.060
It all worked out, so it's all good.

00:19:47.520 --> 00:19:48.810
I'm not mad.

00:19:49.620 --> 00:19:55.080
<i>I'm not wrong. This is the smart way
of living as a clean freak.</i>

00:19:56.040 --> 00:20:00.660
Narita, you're such a good egg!

00:20:00.660 --> 00:20:03.050
Get a room, you two!

00:20:04.810 --> 00:20:07.510
Don't get all hot under the collar.
It's only a hug!

00:20:08.790 --> 00:20:10.460
All right, let's blow this joint.

00:20:16.610 --> 00:20:18.440
<b>Aoi Sanmyaku</b>

00:20:18.440 --> 00:20:23.060
<i>So you were Aoi Sanmyaku, after all...</i>

00:20:25.400 --> 00:20:27.090
Is Aoi Sanmyaku here?

00:20:27.090 --> 00:20:30.870
He went to his room to get 
an item for the quest.

00:20:31.380 --> 00:20:32.600
To his room, huh?

00:20:32.600 --> 00:20:33.550
Got it.

00:20:35.310 --> 00:20:38.800
<i>The gap between his online and 
offline personas threw me off a bit,</i>

00:20:38.800 --> 00:20:41.650
<i>but I guess he can break down the walls
of his germaphobia here,</i>

00:20:41.650 --> 00:20:44.590
<i>and that's why he can show his true face.</i>

00:20:46.250 --> 00:20:51.220
<i>If Aoyama wasn't a clean freak,
maybe he'd be like that in real life, too.</i>

00:20:51.720 --> 00:20:54.270
<i>Anyway, now I just have to
confirm it with him.</i>

00:20:56.520 --> 00:20:58.230
<b>Aoi Sanmyaku</b>

00:20:58.730 --> 00:21:01.610
Hey, Aoi Sanmyaku! It's me, Smart.

00:21:01.610 --> 00:21:02.550
I'm coming in!

00:21:03.190 --> 00:21:05.660
What's up, Guild Leader?

00:21:06.120 --> 00:21:08.020
Huh? You...

00:21:09.120 --> 00:21:12.120
Let's go complete that quest already!

00:21:16.470 --> 00:21:20.350
<i>So he doesn't clean because he likes it?</i>

00:21:30.260 --> 00:21:31.160
I'll help.

00:21:36.520 --> 00:21:37.430
Perfect.

00:21:37.900 --> 00:21:39.530
Or maybe he does...

00:23:14.080 --> 00:23:17.950
For good luck, butt keepie-uppie!

00:23:17.950 --> 00:23:19.360
Focus!

00:23:19.360 --> 00:23:23.010
Our next opponent is
Minamida Fuzoku High School!

00:23:27.480 --> 00:23:30.860
Statues should just stay still.

00:23:37.060 --> 00:23:41.500
<b>Next time</b>

00:23:37.060 --> 00:23:41.500
<b>Tsukamoto-kun's Life Is All About Laughs</b>
